:["0 local","32766 main","32767 default","Order"],"captions":["Priority 0: the local table, the host's own addresses","32766: main, the ordinary routes","32767: default, normally empty","Rules go in increasing order; an empty result moves on"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip rule","0:      from all lookup local","32766:  from all lookup main","32767:  from all lookup default","$ ip route show table local","local 192.168.1.10 dev eth0 scope host","broadcast 192.168.1.255 dev eth0"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip rule","0:      from all lookup local","32766:  from all lookup main","32767:  from all lookup default","$ ip route show table local","local 192.168.1.10 dev eth0 scope host","broadcast 192.168.1.255 dev eth0"],"hl":[2],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip rule","0:      from all lookup local","32766:  from all lookup main","32767:  from all lookup default","$ ip route show table local","local 192.168.1.10 dev eth0 scope host","broadcast 192.168.1.255 dev eth0"],"hl":[3],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ ip rule","0:      from all lookup local","32766:  from all lookup main","32767:  from all lookup default","$ ip route show table local","local 192.168.1.10 dev eth0 scope host","broadcast 192.168.1.255 dev eth0"],"hl":[4,5,6],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[12.4,19.9,27.0]}]},{"title":"Policy routing","sub":"Chapter 9 · Linux networking","short":"Policy","main":"Your own table and a from rule: the reply leaves by the same link.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Table","from","fwmark","Check"],"captions":["Your own table with a default via the second provider's gateway","A rule sends packets from that source address to it","Or packets with an fwmark","route get with from checks the result"],"fr